78
00:04:44,040 --> 00:04:49,000
We're going to go over that later on, but this just updated.

79
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:53,759
This triage router to use stuff in long term memory.

80
00:04:53,759 --> 00:04:56,360
And this is step number one.

81
00:04:56,360 --> 00:04:58,840
After that, we're going to go on to the rest of the agent.

