00:05:03,000 --> 00:05:07,040
We are going to import the memory tools and use those.

85
00:05:07,040 --> 00:05:10,600
We are going to have the system message for the agent.

86
00:05:10,600 --> 00:05:13,640
And now we get down to create prompt.

