00:05:13,640 --> 00:05:16,600
So create prompt is where we are also going to update.

88
00:05:16,600 --> 00:05:20,400
So right now, we're passing in the prompt instructions with agent instructions.

89
00:05:20,400 --> 00:05:22,760
And we're going to do the same thing as above.

90
00:05:22,759 --> 00:05:31,759
We're going to update it so it looks for these in the long term memory store first.

91
00:05:31,759 --> 00:05:40,319
All right, so now we've modified it in a few ways.

92
00:05:40,319 --> 00:05:42,920
We've passed in the config and the store.

93
00:05:42,920 --> 00:05:45,839
We're going to use the config to get the link graph user ID.

94
00:05:45,839 --> 00:05:48,639
And that's going to create the name space that we look in.

95
00:05:48,639 --> 00:05:51,560
The key that we're going to use is agent instructions.

96
00:05:51,560 --> 00:05:53,879
We're going to do similar logic as before.

97
00:05:53,879 --> 00:05:57,639
We're going to first try to get this result from the store.

98
00:05:57,639 --> 00:06:01,519
If it does not exist, we're going to put a default one in there using prompt instructions

